# L §5.14.1 Refusals (2.1-C7b-3): "RUN-CYCLE (... or of the arrival's day's end or later, reached through a computed
# day); RUN-FUTURE (a decision's running read of a day after its own ...)"; L §8.4 RUN-CYCLE "an arrival rule's read of
# its arrival's day's end or later".  As L5_14_1_arrival_reads_end_run, but the computed day is five days after the
# arrival (k0 = 5): RUN-CYCLE, not RUN-FUTURE, which is a decision's.
=== m.tally
model t
  tally 2
  on 2026-01-01
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31

source s "s"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01
kind persons: parties
kind couples: parties
kind savings: place PLN min 0
  owned by arrive
  step minor(PLN)
  takes k for w prorata
kind interests: transfers
kind tomeks: transfers
input k0: int
place konto: savings lives 2026-01-01..
place dep: savings lives 2026-01-01..
place world: outside lives 1900-01-01..
place shop: outside lives 1900-01-01..
input a1_day: date
input a1_amt: money PLN
input t1_day: date
input t1_amt: money PLN
input i1_day: date
input i1_amt: money PLN
def arrive[m in events, p in parties]: num at m.day
  rule base = if p == ania then 1 else 0
  rule t beats base = if p == tomek then 1 else 0 when m in tomeks
  rule income beats base, t = bal(dep, add_days(m.day, k0)) of p / bal(dep, add_days(m.day, k0)) when m in interests
move a1: transfers
  on a1_day
  leg cash from world to dep amount a1_amt
move t1: tomeks
  on t1_day
  leg cash from world to dep amount t1_amt
move i1: interests
  on i1_day
  leg cash from world to konto amount i1_amt
ask q: bal(konto, 2026-03-31) of ania, bal(konto, 2026-03-31) of tomek, k0

version v
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2026-01-01
  persons + [ania] lives 1980-01-01..
  persons + [tomek] lives 1981-01-01..
  couples + [ania_tomek] lives 2010-06-01..
  opening[konto] = 0 PLN at 2026-01-01 start
  opening[dep] = 0 PLN at 2026-01-01 start
  a1_day = 2026-02-01
  a1_amt = 300.00 PLN
  t1_day = 2026-02-02
  t1_amt = 100.00 PLN
  i1_day = 2026-03-01
  i1_amt = 40.00 PLN
  k0 = 5
=== expect
q: (refused: RUN-CYCLE arrive[i1, *] reads itself through bal(dep, 2026-03-06): the end of its arrival's day or later, refused: RUN-CYCLE arrive[i1, *] reads itself through bal(dep, 2026-03-06): the end of its arrival's day or later, 5)
  cut 2026-01-01
